  "editorReview": {
    "text": "This microhistory achieves moments of genuine archival texture and narrative elegance, particularly in the poignant Sanremo chapters that ground Pietri's story in documentary specifics. Its final argument, linking his collapse to the enduring template of sporting tragedy, is powerful and well-supported. However, the narrative's structural ambition is also its weakness; the proliferation of chapters creates a mid-book drift into repetitive, institutional surveys that occasionally lose sight of Pietri's intimate story. The thematic coherence around the 'machinery of spectacle' remains strong, bu",
